      "content": "It sounds incredibly painful watching your children carry this emotional weight, and your desire for them to breathe freely without your stress is completely understandable. Please know that their energy drain is often a survival mechanism, not a judgment on your value as a parent. While healing a chronic condition rarely solves the drama in one conversation, finding even one small moment where they can simply breathe without calculating your needs would be a profound victory.",
      "source": "target",
